          "java",
          "// Configuration / Composition Root\nContainer container = new Container();\ncontainer.registerSingleton(OrderRepository.class, new PostgresOrderRepository());\ncontainer.registerSingleton(EmailService.class, new SmtpEmailService());\ncontainer.registerSingleton(PaymentGateway.class, new StripePaymentGateway());\ncontainer.registerFactory(OrderService.class, () -> new OrderService(\n    container.resolve(OrderRepository.class),\n    container.resolve(EmailService.class),\n    container.resolve(PaymentGateway.class)\n));\n\n// Usage\nOrderService service = container.resolve(OrderService.class);"
        ]
      ]
